text.en:
There is hereby further appropriated for the University of the Philippines out of the general funds in the National Treasury not otherwise appropriated, an amount of twenty-one million pesos as the Government’s contribution towards the financing of the development program of the University of the Philippines for the College of Agriculture at Los Baños, Laguna. The amount of twenty-one million peso so appropriated shall be released to the University of the Philippines in the following manner:
Four million pesos in the fiscal year nineteen hundred sixty-four to nineteen hundred sixty-five;
Ten million pesos in the fiscal year nineteen hundred sixty-five to nineteen hundred sixty-six; and Seven million pesos in the fiscal year nineteen hundred sixty-six to nineteen hundred sixty-seven.
